2b: confirm Floor/HP/Gold update within roughly poll_interval_seconds during a live run, and the dashboard hides itself a while after /game_stop or after leaving a run.
2c: confirm the character's gaze shifts to the biased point when autonomous play starts, and returns to mouse-follow after /game_stop.
